               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Alot of efforts to narrow this down and fix it.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Right now - have workaround which is define",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "#if\t\tqIterationOnCopiedContainer_ThreadSafety_Buggy",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "and add extra lock around iteration.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "ALL you need to repdouce bug is to copy a container and iterator on that copy in one thread while appending in another.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "NOT 100% clear if this is a real bug or a quirk of notifying helgrind. Also not clear if I need atomic_thread_fance calls (I added in ifdef/comment in regtest that fails).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
