                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "I worked on this again. No luck.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "I rewrote how we support iterator objects, so they now longer use shared_ptr - they copy direcyly. Not sure that is better or worse performance wise (no measurable difference in my tests). But it didnt help this issue except to eliminate one possible cause of problems.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "To reproduce, run",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "Builds/g++-debug-sanitize_thread_undefined/Test39",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "valgrind test.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Use the attached patch before building to narrow issue and disable bug workaround. ",
